ty=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"383.7967625899281\" cy=\"104.3716354551101\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"392.5539568345324\" cy=\"104.92854254778501\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"406.1762589928058\" cy=\"93.53483658286063\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"423.6906474820144\" cy=\"89.24988345610313\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"432.4478417266188\" cy=\"88.56597084054178\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"441.2050359712231\" cy=\"89.24988345610313\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"454.8273381294964\" cy=\"84.03077928550348\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"472.3417266187051\" cy=\"79.20205317932601\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"481.0989208633094\" cy=\"78.42986379756286\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"489.85611510791375\" cy=\"79.20205317932601\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"503.4784172661871\" cy=\"77.43372668829315\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"520.9928057553957\" cy=\"72.20788400737328\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"529.75\" cy=\"71.37106926539275\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"538.5071942446044\" cy=\"72.20788400737328\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"552.1294964028777\" cy=\"72.58544280847673\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"569.6438848920864\" cy=\"67.0574403992911\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"578.4010791366907\" cy=\"66.1713679350762\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"435.36690647482015\" cy=\"106.18390069135938\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"452.8812949640288\" cy=\"102.5710374718675\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"461.63848920863313\" cy=\"101.99586914684883\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"470.3956834532375\" cy=\"102.5710374718675\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"484.0179856115108\" cy=\"91.64808788743588\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"501.53237410071944\" cy=\"87.25783922312525\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"510.2895683453238\" cy=\"86.55685275351436\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"519.0467625899282\" cy=\"87.25783922312525\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"532.6690647482014\" cy=\"82.41333496153496\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"550.18345323741\" cy=\"77.48873928127443\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"558.9406474820145\" cy=\"76.70096029938341\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"567.6978417266188\" cy=\"77.48873928127443\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"581.3201438848921\" cy=\"76.02173089862131\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#b5692b\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"422.7176258992806\" cy=\"72.4590163934426\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#7659a8\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><text class=\"plot-x-label\" x=\"394.5\" y=\"324\" text-anchor=\"middle\">成本 / 教学单位</text><text class=\"plot-y-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"157.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 24 157.5)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">最坏产量代理 / m³/d</text></g></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>候选成本—最坏产量图与穿深敏感性曲线并列，揭示名义高产并不等于对损害误差稳健。三个情景是手工扰动，不是置信区间。图中是初始参数的固定种子教学计算，交互演示可重新计算。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "损害情景与稳健搜索",
          "html": "<p>同一射孔穿深在轻损害与重损害井况下可能产生不同连通效果，设计需要关注方案对损害估计偏差的敏感性。AI优化流程采用可解释的情景搜索，对100组孔密、相位与穿深分别计算三种损害厚度下的表皮和产量代理。算法以最坏情景表现减去成本惩罚排序，并同时检查预算与出砂代理上限。</p><p>所有候选 · 可行候选 · 推荐；横轴：成本 / 教学单位；纵轴：最坏产量代理 / m³/d。</p><p>一次搜索完成100组方案在三种损害条件下的300次响应评价，交付可行参数清单、名义与最坏产量代理、成本和出砂分数。设计人员能直接查看推荐方案在损害加重时保留的表现，以及穿深变化对情景差距的影响。这把逐方案反复切换损害假设的工作整合为统一比较，也保留了推荐所依据的预算和风险条件。</p><p><b>默认教学搜索对100组射孔参数逐一检查预算与出砂约束，筛出92组可行候选，后续在这92组中比较三种损害情景的最坏响应。默认排序首位为8孔/米、90°相位和0.6米穿深，对应最坏产量代理58.14立方米/日。</b></p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "损害估计与响应对照资料",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">试点准备10—20组目标层或邻井工况，整理损害带厚度、渗流能力、岩石强度、射孔参数与费用，并用产能或试井资料核对响应尺度。稳健搜索需要情景范围与约束，无需人工标注最佳参数。本例把给定损害厚度乘以0.7、1和1.3构成三种教学情景，用同一表皮代理计算各方案对损害变化的响应。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">储层与力学参数</span><span class=\"cl-s\">应力、强度、渗透率</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">无需标注</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">射孔方案与测试产量</span><span class=\"cl-s\">历史井数据</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">200—500 井次</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">出砂与作业反馈</span><span class=\"cl-s\">出砂、措施记录</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">约束条件</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工复核记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">保留复核对象、原始证据与修订结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">损害厚度、渗流能力、强度与费用</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">样本版本与评价明细</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按原始对象分组，保留评价记录与版本</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于复查数值和追踪更新</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">专业资料与数据依据</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/terms/p/perforate\">SLB：射孔基本定义<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://www.slb.com/-/media/files/oilfield-review/p54-69\">SLB：射孔策略<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/terms/s/skin\">SLB：表皮<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "情景范围与表皮敏感性",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">损害厚度范围与表皮响应标定决定排序</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>主要障碍是损害厚度通常来自间接解释，范围设得过窄会遗漏不利条件，过宽又可能使选择过于保守。应结合邻井试井与损害描述核对情景上下界，并检查渗流能力和强度输入的尺度。复核要同时比较名义与最坏表现，确认推荐来自对不利情景的承受能力，而非仅由成本惩罚或某一名义点决定。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">代理模型<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">多目标优化<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/opt\">实验设计<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "损害不确定条件射孔比选",
      "lead": [
        "射孔设计人员需要在损害厚度不确定时寻找预算与出砂约束内表现稳定的组合。 本例使用教学合成资料，案例规模与处理口径如下。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "损害情景",
          "0.7 / 1 / 1.3 倍"
        ],
        [
          "射孔组合",
          "100 种"
        ],
        [
          "比选依据",
          "三情景最小产量"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "损害情景构造",
          "role": "数据",
          "do": "按当前损害厚度×0.7/1/1.3构造三种假设。",
          "effect": "明确本例处理规模与资料分组：损害情景 0.7 / 1 / 1.3 倍；射孔组合 100 种；比选依据 三情景最小产量。"
        },
        {
          "name": "射孔参数组合枚举",
          "role": "算法",
          "do": "枚举100种孔密、相位及穿深。",
          "effect": "保留射孔参数组合枚举的中间结果，供下一环节核对与比较。"
        },
        {
          "name": "最坏表现评价",
          "role": "算法",
          "do": "根据教学表皮公式预测产量，取三情景最小值。",
          "effect": "保留最坏表现评价的中间结果，供下一环节核对与比较。"
        },
        {
          "name": "预算风险约束筛选",
          "role": "评价",
          "do": "过滤预算及出砂代理上限，按最坏产量减成本惩罚选点。",
          "effect": "交付各情景产量及最坏情景排序；查看推荐对损害厚度变化的敏感程度。"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "流程产出与评价口径",
        "html": "<figure class=\"figure\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"案例业务流程，窄屏可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 780 150\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"损害情景构造 → 射孔参数组合枚举 → 最坏表现评价 → 预算风险约束筛选\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:780px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><title>案例业务流程</title><rect x=\"10\" y=\"20\" width=\"174\" height=\"110\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f1eb\"/><text x=\"97\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#47695b\">1 · 数据</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#243e35\">损害情景构造</text><path d=\"M184 76h16m-5-5 5 5-5 5\" stroke=\"#47695b\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"20\" width=\"174\" height=\"110\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e9edf7\"/><text x=\"287\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#47695b\">2 · 算法</text><text x=\"287\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#243e35\">射孔参数组合枚举</text><path d=\"M374 76h16m-5-5 5 5-5 5\" stroke=\"#47695b\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"390\" y=\"20\" width=\"174\" height=\"110\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f1eb\"/><text x=\"477\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#47695b\">3 · 算法</text><text x=\"477\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#243e35\">最坏表现评价</text><path d=\"M564 76h16m-5-5 5 5-5 5\" stroke=\"#47695b\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"580\" y=\"20\" width=\"174\" height=\"110\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e9edf7\"/><text x=\"667\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#47695b\">4 · 评价</text><text x=\"667\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#243e35\">预算风险约束筛选</text></svg></div><figcaption>每个环节对应下方的业务输入、计算操作及结果用途。</figcaption></figure><p>最坏表现=min情景产量代理；目标=最坏表现−成本惩罚×成本。非概率稳健场景不能报告概率覆盖。</p><p><strong>成果交付：</strong>交付各情景产量及最坏情景排序；查看推荐对损害厚度变化的敏感程度。</p>"
      },
